Z||000000||TRiAD||12-27-2001||05:56 PM||||Saw a gated shift plate for manual Fiero (I think they had 4 and 5sp) some time ago, I think it was in a Kit Car ad for the Fiero Store, the Fiero Shop, or some other company. <P>I was wondering if anyone knew if or where they could still be found. <P>Thanks!<BR><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://centralillinoisimports.org/uploads/files/SigRear4.gif">  <BR><B><I><FONT COLOR="blue">Project MR1 ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</B><BR>AIM ~ Michael Blue 72</I></FONT>||||reg||1
